      "widgets_values": [
        "## flux-schnell.json\n\nApache-2.0 few-step base (FLUX.1-schnell, fp8). Graph from the official\nComfyUI_examples flux_schnell example (SamplerCustomAdvanced chain).\n4 steps Euler/simple, no guidance (guidance-distilled). DualCLIP\n(t5xxl fp8 + clip_l), ae VAE. Native 1024. CLIP type `flux` is the\nrouter, not a model identity.\n---\n*How to run it: story **S1** in `HOWTO.md`  ·  Why it is this way: **E35/E36** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
